---
import { site } from '../data/content';
---
<section class="closing">
  <div class="container closing-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="closing-rule"></div>
      <h2 class="heading-3">Let’s turn physical climate risk into an input your capital and credit decisions can use.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="closing-lead">For credit institutions, infrastructure owners and sovereigns: analysis built for the challenges climate imposes on your business. Let’s discuss your priorities.</p>
    <div class="closing-contacts">
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"/></svg>
        {site.email}
      </a>
      <a href={`tel:${site.phone.replace(/\s/g, '')}`}>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2"/></svg>
        {site.phone}
      </a>
      <span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s7-6.5 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.5 7 11 7 11Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></svg>
        Vancouver, Canada · Working globally
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
